"<guimenuitem>Plot Data...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu item. You choose "
"what you want to plot on the y-axis and a range of elements to plot that for "
"on the x-axis. The screenshot below shows the atomic mass of the elements 1 "
"to 10. Click the swap button between the axis panes to swap X and Y axes."
msgstr ""
"Možete postaviti podatke koristeći <menuchoice> <guimenu>Alati</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Postavite podatke...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> stavku menija. "
"Možete odabrati šta želite da postavite na y-osu i rang elemenata koji "
"želite postaviti na x- osu. Slike ispod pokazuju atomske mase elemenata 1 do "
"10."

