#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bohr Orbitals"
msgstr "Bohrove orbite"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Atom Model</guilabel> page displays the atomic shells. Every "
"orbit stands for a atomic shell and every yellow circle represents an "
"electron."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Model atoma</guilabel> stranica prikazuje atomske okvir. Svaka "
"orbita je atomski okvir i svaki žuti krug je elektron."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Isotopes"
msgstr "Izotopi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Isotopes</guilabel> page presents information about the "
"isotopes of an element."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izotopi</guilabel> stranica prikazuje informacije o izotopima "
"elementa."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mass"
msgstr "Masa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "The mass of this isotope."
msgstr "Masa ovog izotopa."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Neutrons"
msgstr "Neutroni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of neutrons this isotope has."
msgstr "Broj neutrona koje izotop ima."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Procenat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The percentage of atoms occurring that are of this isotope type. Also called "
"abundance."
msgstr "Procenat atoma koji su izotopi ovog tipa. Takođe se naziva obilnost."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Half-life period"
msgstr "Period poluraspada"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only unstable isotopes have a half-life period. It is defined as the time in "
"which half the isotopes decay."
msgstr ""
"Samo nestablni izotopi imaju period poluraspada. On je definisan kao vrijeme "
"za koje se raspadne polovina izotopa."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Energy and Mode of Decay"
msgstr "Energija i režim raspada"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some isotopes are known to emit particle radiation under the process of "
"radioactive decay. Each decay transformation has a typical energy release, "
"which is listed along with the mode of decay."
msgstr ""
"Neki izotopi su poznati po tome što emituju radijacijsku česticu u toku "
"procesa radioaktivnog raspada. Svaka transformacija u obliku raspada "
"oslobađa određenu energiju, koja je prikazana zajedno sa načinom raspada."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spin and Parity"
msgstr "Spin i paritet"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "The spin of the nucleus and its parity."
msgstr "Spin jezgra i njegov paritet."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "Magnetic Moment"
msgstr "Magnetski moment"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The magnetic dipole moment of the nucleus. Measured in units of the nuclear "
"magneton."
msgstr ""
"Magnetski dipolski momenat jezgra. Mjeren u jedinicama nuklearnog megnetona."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Razno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Miscellaneous</guilabel> page tells you other information "
"about the current element, including when it was discovered and the origin "
"of the name."
msgstr ""
"Stranica <guilabel>Razno</guilabel> vam govori ostale informacije o "
"trenutnom elementu, uključujući kada je otkriven i korijen imena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spectrum"
msgstr "Spektar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Spectrum</guilabel> page shows you elements spectrum. You can "
"choose the range of the wavelengths, units and type of the spectrum. The "
"intensity table can be seen at the right bottom part of the page."
msgstr ""
"Stranica <guilabel>Spektar</guilabel> prikazuje spektar elemenata. Možete "
"odabrati rang talasnih dužina, jedinice i tip spektra. Tabela intenziteta je "
"vidljiva na donjem desnom dijelu stranice."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extra Information"
msgstr "Dodatne Informacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Extra information</guilabel> page gives you the links to "
#| "the element pages on Wikipedia, <ulink url=\"http://education.jlab.org/"
#| "\">Jefferson Lab</ulink>, and <ulink url=\"http://www.webelements.com/"
#| "\">WebElements</ulink>."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Extra information</guilabel> page gives you the links to the "
"element pages on Wikipedia, <ulink url=\"https://education.jlab.org/"
"\">Jefferson Lab</ulink>, and <ulink url=\"https://www.webelements.com/"
"\">WebElements</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Stranica <guilabel>Dodatne informacije</guilabel> daje vam linkove do "
"elemenata na Wikipediji, <ulink url=\"http://education.jlab.org/\">Jefferson "
"Lab</ulink>, i <ulink url=\"http://www.webelements.com/\">WebElements</"
"ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:343 index.docbook:812
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tabele"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The periodic table can be presented in various ways. You can switch the "
"table view from <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu or toolbar drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"Periodni sistem može biti prikazan na više načina. Možete promijeniti prikaz "
"tabele iz  <guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> menija ili ispustiti-dolje liste alatne "
"trake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following options in the <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Tables</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu can be used to change "
"the table shown:"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće opcije u <menuchoice><guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tabele</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> meniju mogu biti korištene da promijenite "
"prikazane tabele:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "Classic Periodic Table"
msgstr "Klasični periodni sistem"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352 index.docbook:1013
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Display</action> the classic periodic table with all elements."
msgstr "<action>Prikaži</action> klasični periodni sistem sa svim elementima."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "Short Periodic Table"
msgstr "Kratki periodni sistem"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:360 index.docbook:1021
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Display</action> a periodic table without transition elements."
msgstr "<action>Prikaži</action> periodni sistem bez prelaznih elemenata."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "Long Periodic Table"
msgstr "Dugi periodni sistem"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:368 index.docbook:1029
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Display</action> a periodic table with inner transition elements (f-"
"elements) embedded."
msgstr ""
"<action>Prikaži</action> periodni sistem sa ugrađenim unutrašnjim prelaznim "
"elementima (f- elementima)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transition Elements"
msgstr "Prijelazni elementi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376 index.docbook:1037
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Display</action> a periodic table only with transition elements."
msgstr ""
"<action>Prikaži</action> periodni sistem sa samo prijelaznim elementima."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid "DZ Periodic Table"
msgstr "DZ periodni sistem"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384 index.docbook:1045
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This item represents the table the DZ <foreignphrase lang=\"de\">Deutscher "
"Zentralausschuss</foreignphrase> \"German Central Committee\" suggests."
msgstr ""
"Ova stavka predstavlja tabelu DZ <foreignphrase lang=\"de\">Deutscher "
"Zentralausschuss</foreignphrase> \"German Central Committee\" sugestira."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "Numeration"
msgstr "Prebrojavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The numeration is the way of numbering the 18 groups of the periodic table. "
"You can change the numeration to <guilabel>IUPAC</guilabel>, <guilabel>old "
"IUPAC</guilabel> or <guilabel>CAS</guilabel>, or you can switch it off "
"entirely."
msgstr ""
"Prebrojavanje je način numerisanja 18 grupa periodnog sistema. Možete "
"promijeniti prebrojavanje u <guilabel>IUPAC</guilabel>, <guilabel>old IUPAC</"
"guilabel> ili <guilabel>CAS</guilabel>, ili ga možete potpuno promijeniti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following options in the <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Numeration</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu can be used to "
"change the numeration shown:"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće opcije u <menuchoice><guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Prebrojavanje</guimenuitem></menuchoice>:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>No Numeration</guimenuitem>: if this option is active, no "
"period-numeration will be in effect."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Nema prebrojavanja</guimenuitem>: ako je ova opcija aktivna, "
"prebrojavanje perioda neće biti efektno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>IUPAC</guimenuitem> (default) is the <firstterm>International "
"Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry</firstterm>. This is an organization "
"which defines most of the standards for chemical concerns. The new IUPAC "
"system numbers each column with Arabic numbers from 1 (one) through 18 "
"(eighteen)."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>IUPAC</guimenuitem> (zadanp) je<firstterm>International Union "
"of Pure and Applied Chemistry</firstterm>.  Ovo je organizacija koja "
"definiše najviše standarda koji se tiču hemije. Novi IUPAC sistem numeriše "
"svaku kolonu arapskim brojem od 1(jedan) do 18(osamnaest)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>CAS</guimenuitem> is the <firstterm>Chemical Abstracts Service</"
"firstterm>. In the CAS system the letters A and B were designated to main "
"group elements (A) and transition elements (B). Though the <acronym>IUPAC</"
"acronym> numeration is the official, the <acronym>CAS</acronym> numeration "
"is what is still used in classrooms and laboratories."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>CAS</guimenuitem> je <firstterm>Chemical Abstracts Service</"
"firstterm>. U CAS sistemu slova A i B su dodijeljena glavnoj grupi elemenata "
"(A) i prijelaznim elementima (B). Iako je <acronym>IUPAC</acronym>  "
"numeracija oficijalna, <acronym>CAS</acronym>  numeracija se još uvijek "
"koristi u učionicama i laboratorijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Old IUPAC</guimenuitem> system labeled columns with Roman "
"numerals followed by either the letter <quote>A</quote> or <quote>B</quote>. "
"Columns were numbered such that columns one through seven were numbered "
"<quote>IA</quote> through <quote>VIIA</quote>, columns 8 through 10 were "
"labeled <quote>VIIIA</quote>, columns 11 through 17 were numbered <quote>IB</"
"quote> through <quote>VIIB</quote> and column 18 was numbered <quote>VIII</"
"quote>. Because of the confusion the old IUPAC and the CAS system created, "
"the IUPAC adopted their new system."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Stari IUPAC</guimenuitem>sistem obilježava kolone Rimskim "
"brojevima praćenim slovom  <quote>A</quote> ili <quote>B</quote>. Kolone su "
"numerisane tako da su kolone od jedan do sedam numerisane  <quote>IA</quote> "
"do <quote>VIIA</quote>, kolone 8 do 10 označene sa <quote>VIIIA</quote>, "
"kolone 11 do 17 numerisane sa <quote>IB</quote> do <quote>VIIB</quote> i "
"kolona 19 numerisana sa <quote>VIII</quote> . Zbog zabune koji su stari "
"IUPAC i CAS sistem kreirali IUPAC je usvojio novi sistem."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color schemes"
msgstr "Šeme boja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalzium; can show you which elements are where with regard to their "
"Periodic <quote>block</quote> and <quote>group</quote>, their behavior with "
"acid and which state of matter (&ie; solid/liquid/vapor) they are in at a "
"given temperature."
msgstr ""
"&kalzium; može pokazati koji elementi su gdje obzirom na njihov Periodni "
"<quote>blok</quote> i <quote>grupu</quote>, njihovo ponašanje sa kiselinama "
"i koje stanje materije ( &ie; čvrsto/tečno/gasovito) imaju na datoj "
"temperaturi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Color schemes can be changed in the <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Scheme</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu, toolbar drop-down list, "
"or <link linkend=\"view_tab\">View</link> tab of the Sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Šeme boja mogu biti promijenjene u <menuchoice><guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Šeme</guimenuitem></menuchoice> meniju, alatnoj traci ispusti-"
"dolje listi, ili <link linkend=\"view_tab\">Prikaz</link> tabu na traci sa "
"strane."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Monochrome</guimenuitem>: all the elements have the same color. "
"You can change the default color by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kalzium;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> and "
"going to the <guilabel>Schemes</guilabel> page."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Monohromatski</guimenuitem>: svi elementi imaju istu boju. "
"Možete promijeniti zadanu boju birajući <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kalzium;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> i "
"iduči na <guilabel>Šeme</guilabel> stranicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Blocks</guimenuitem>: displays a color for each block."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Blokovi</guimenuitem>: prikazuju boju za svaki blok."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Iconic</guimenuitem>: displays icons for each element."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Ikonski</guimenuitem>: prikazuje ikone za svaki element."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Family</guimenuitem>: represents each of the nine families with "
"a color."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Porodica</guimenuitem>: prikazuje svaku od devet prodica bojom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Groups</guimenuitem>: displays a color for each group. A group "
"is a vertical column in the periodic table of the elements. There are 18 "
"groups in the standard periodic table. Elements in a group have similar "
"configurations of their valence shell electrons, which gives them similar "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Grupe</guimenuitem>: prikazuje boju za svaku grupu. Grupa je "
"vertikalna kolona u periodnom sistemu elemenata. Postoji 18 grupa u "
"standradnom periodnom sistemu. Elementi u grupu imaju sličnu konfiguraciju "
"njihovih valentnih elektrona, što im daje slična svojstva."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Gradients</title>"
msgstr "<title>Gradijenti</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The gradient views displays the elements according to a property you can "
"select below and with a gradient colored scheme. The elements for which the "
"data is not available are displayed in gray."
msgstr ""
"Gradijenti prikazuju elemente prema svojstvu koji možete odabrati ispod i sa "
"gradijent obojenom shemom. Elementi za oje podaci nisu dosutpni su obojeni "
"sivo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gradients can be changed in the <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Gradients</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu, toolbar drop-down "
"list, or <link linkend=\"view_tab\">View</link> tab of the Sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Gradijenti mogu biti promijenjeni u  <menuchoice><guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Gradijenti</guimenuitem></menuchoice> meniju, ispusti-dolje "
"alatnoj traci, ili  <link linkend=\"view_tab\">Prikaz</link> tabu na traci "
"sa strane."

