#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:502
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "On the right of the <guilabel>Molecular Editor</guilabel> window the "
#| "molecule will be shown. Use &LMB; to rotate molecule, &RMB; to move it, "
