#: index.docbook:523
#, no-c-format
msgid "Isotope Table"
msgstr "Tablica izotopa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Isotope Table...</guimenuitem> shows you the isotopes of "
"the elements."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Tablica izotopa...</guimenuitem> pokazuje izuotope elemenata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are different kinds of isotopes, some are stable, some are not. The "
"unstable isotopes can decay as alpha-rays are two different beta-rays. These "
"differences are encoded by using different colors."
msgstr ""
"Postoje različite vrste izotopa, neki stablini, neki ne. Nestabilni izotopi "
"se raspadaju u vidu alfa-zraka i dvije različite beta-zrake. Ove razlike su "
"kodirane korištenjem boja."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Isotope Table</quote> window"
msgstr "prozor <quote>Tablica izotopa</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; can display the isotopes of a range of elements"
msgstr "&kalzium; može prikazati izotope ranga elemenata"

