"The <guimenuitem>Plot Data...</guimenuitem> dialog allows you to plot some "
"information about elements. The X-axis represents a range of elements (from "
"one number to a higher number). You set this range using the <guilabel>First "
"Element</guilabel> and <guilabel>Last Element</guilabel> fields on the "
"dialog. Click the swap button between the axis panes to swap X and Y axes."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Podaci za crtanje...</guimenuitem> vam omogućuje da crtate "
"informacije o elementima. X osa predstavlja rang elemenata ( od prvog broja "
"ka višem ). MOžete postaviti ovaj rang koristeći  <guilabel>Prvi Element</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Zadnji Element</guilabel> polja dijaloga."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Plot Data</quote> Dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Podaci za crtanje</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; can plot some data about a range of elements."
msgstr "&kalzium; može crtati neke podatke o rangu elemenata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid "Perform Calculation"
msgstr "Izvedi računanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Perform Calculation</guilabel> is the &kalzium; calculator. "
"This calculator contains a variety of calculators for different tasks "
"performing different calculations."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izvedi računanje</guilabel> je &kalzium; kalkulator. Ovi "
"kalkulatori sadrže mnogo kalkulatora za različite zadatke koji rade "
"različite kalkulacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can find the following calculators in &kalzium;"
msgstr "Možete naći sljedeće kalkulatore u &kalziumu;-u"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "Molecular mass calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator molekularne mase"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This calculator helps you calculate the molecular masses of different "
"molecules."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj kalkulator vam pomaže pri računanju molekluarne mase različitih "
"molekula."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:576
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can specify short form of the molecule names add more such aliases."
msgstr ""
"Možete navesti kratki oblik imena molekula dodaje još takvih pseudonima."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Molecular mass calculator</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Kalkulator molekularne mase</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; calculates molecular mass of phenol."
msgstr "&kalzium; računa molekularnu masu fenola."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concentrations calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator koncentracija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can calculate quantities which include"
msgstr "Možete izračunati kvanintete koji uključuju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid "Amount of substance"
msgstr "Količinu supstance"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:606
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume of solvent"
msgstr "Jačinu otapanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:611
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concentration of substance"
msgstr "Koncentraciju supstance"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are a wide range of units to choose from and different methods to "
"specify quantities."
msgstr ""
"Širok je rang polja za izabrati i različitih metoda za specificiranje "
"kvantiteta."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Concentrations calculator</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Kalkulator koncentracija</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; calculates solution parameters."
msgstr "&kalzium; računa parametre rješenja."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:634
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nuclear calculator"
msgstr "Nuklearni kalkulator."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This calculator makes use of the nuclear data available in &kalzium; to "
"predict the expected masses of a material after time."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj kalkulator koristi nuklearne podatke dostupne u &kalziumu;-u da "
"predvidi očekivane mase i materijale nakon vremena."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:645
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Nuclear calculator</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Nuklearni kalkulator</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:647
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; calculates parameters of uranium decay."
msgstr "&kalzium; računa parametre raspada urana."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:654
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gas calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator plina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This calculator can calculate the values of Temperature, pressure, volume, "
"amount of gas etc. for various ideal as well as non-ideal gases."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj kalkulator računa vrijednosti Temperatore, pritiska, zapremine, "
"količine gasa etd. za različite idealne kao i realne gasove."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:665
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Gas calculator</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Plin kalkulator</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; calculates gas parameters."
msgstr "&kalzium; računa gasne paramtere."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:674
#, no-c-format
msgid "Titration calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator titranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:676
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This calculator tries to find out the equivalence point of a pH-meter "
"followed titration best fitting it with an hyperbolic tangent. You can also "
"let it solve an equilibrium system of equations and see how the "
"concentration of a species changes in function of another one."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj kalkulator pokušava pronaći ekvivalentnu tačku pH-metra titracije koja "
"najbolje odgovara hiperboličkoj tngenti. MOžete takođe riješiti "
"ekvilibrisjski sistem jednačina i vidjeti kako se koncentracija vrste "
"mijenja u zavisnosti od druge."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two tabs on the calculator page, namely:"
msgstr "Dva su tabal na stranici kalkulatora, nazvani:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:684
#, no-c-format
msgid "Experimental Values"
msgstr "Eksperimentalne vrijendnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:686
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use this calculator to draw the plot of your experimental data "
"obtained during a titration and find out the volume of equivalence. It's "
"strongly recommended to insert a even number of points, because of the best "
"fit algorithm, sorted by volume (the X axis value)."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti ovaj kalkulator da crtate podlogu za vaše eksperimentalne "
"podatke dobijene tokom titranja i odrediti zapreminu. Jako je preporučljivo "
"da odaberete paran broj tačaka, zbog najboljeg algoritma, sortirano po "
"zapremini ( x veličina )."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid "Theoretical Equations"
msgstr "Teorijske jednačine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can fill the table with the equations you have previously obtained "
"for the chemical equilibrium."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete popuniti tabelu sa jednačina koje ste prethodno dobili za "
"hemijski ekvilibrum."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:697
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you have this reaction <emphasis>A + B -> C + D</emphasis> "
"then you will have the equation <emphasis>K=(C*D)/(A*B)</emphasis> so you "
"must write <userinput>K</userinput> in the <guilabel>Parameter</guilabel> "
"column and <userinput>(C*D)/(A*B)</userinput> in the <guilabel>Value</"
"guilabel> column. If you want to assign a known value to a parameter you can "
"simply write the numeric value in the <guilabel>Value</guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer ako imate ovu reakciju <emphasis>A + B -> C + D</emphasis> tada "
"ćete imati ovu jednačinu <emphasis>K=(C*D)/(A*B)</emphasis> pa morate "
"napisati <userinput>K</userinput> u <guilabel>Parametar</guilabel> koloni i "
"<userinput>(C*D)/(A*B)</userinput> u  <guilabel>Vrijednost</guilabel> "
"koloni.. Ako želite dodijeliti poznatu virjednost parametra možete "
"jednostavno napisati brojčanu vrijednost u  <guilabel>Vrijednost</guilabel> "
"polje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid "For example, you can use the system"
msgstr "Na primjer možete koristiti sistem"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:704
#, no-c-format
msgid "A=(C*D)/(B*K)"
msgstr "A=(C*D)/(B*K)"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:707
#, no-c-format
msgid "K=10^-3"
msgstr "K=10^-3"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid "C=OH"
msgstr "C=OH"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:713
#, no-c-format
msgid "OH=(10^-14)/H"
msgstr "OH=(10^-14)/H"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid "H=10^-4"
msgstr "H=10^-4"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:719
#, no-c-format
msgid "B=6*(10^-2)"
msgstr "B=6*(10^-2)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:721
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then you have to write <userinput>D</userinput> as <guilabel>X axis</"
"guilabel> and <userinput>A</userinput> as <guilabel>Y axis</guilabel>: so "
"you will find out how the concentration of A changes as a function of D "
"concentration."
msgstr ""
"Onda morate napisati <userinput>D</userinput> kao <guilabel>X osa</guilabel> "
"i <userinput>A</userinput> kao <guilabel>Y osa</guilabel>: pa ćete vidjeti "
"kako se koncentracija od A mijenja u funkciji od koncentracije B."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:725
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please don't use parenthesis for exponents: <userinput>10^-3</userinput> is "
"correct, while <userinput>10^(-3)</userinput> is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Molimo da ne koristite zagrade za eksponente :  <userinput>10^-3</userinput> "
"je tačno, dok <userinput>10^(-3)</userinput> je pogrešno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The results can be visualized by pressing <guibutton>Draw Plot</guibutton> "
"button. The plot shows in red the curve that comes from theoretical "
"equations, in blue the experimental points, and in green the approximated "
"curve for experimental points. You can save the plot as SVG image."
msgstr ""
"Rezutati se mogu vijdeti pritiskom na <guibutton>Navrtaj podlogu</guibutton> "
"dugme. Podloga pokazazuje krivu u crvenom koja dolazi od teorijskih "
"jedanačina, plavom eksperientalne tačke, i zeleno približnu krivu "
"eksperimentalnih tačaka. Možete spremiti crtež kao SVG sliku."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Titration calculator</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Kalkulator titranja</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:743
#, no-c-format
msgid "Predefined example of titration results."
msgstr "Predifinirani primjer rezultata titranja."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equation Balancer"
msgstr "Izjednačitelj jednačina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Equation Balancer</guimenuitem> enables the user to solve "
"chemical equations. This is an example:"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Izjednačitelj jednačina</guimenuitem> omogućava korisniku da "
"rješava hemijske jednačine. Ovo je primjer:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:755
#, no-c-format
msgid "aH2O + bCO2 -> cH2CO3"
msgstr "aH2O + bCO2 -> cH2CO3"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The computed equation will be displayed on the top of the window. As you can "
"see in the first example you can also define the value of one or more "
"coefficients. The other coefficients will be adjusted. Furthermore, it is "
"possible to use brackets around elements or electronic charges as shown in "
"the last two examples."
msgstr ""
"Izračunata jednačina će biti prikazana na vrhu prozora. Kao što možete "
"vidjeti u prvo primjeru možete takođe definisati vrijednost jdnog od više "
"koeficijenata. Ostali koeficijenti će biti prilagođeni. Dalje, moguće je "
"koristiti zagrade oko elemenata ili naboja kao što je prikazano u posljednja "
"dva primjera."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Equation Balancer</quote> dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Uravnoteženje jednačina</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; calculates equation balance."
msgstr "&kalzium; računa balans jednačina."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:776
#, no-c-format
msgid "Risk/Security Phrases"
msgstr "Rizične/sigurne fraze"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The R/S Phrases, also known as Risk and Safety Statements, R/S statements, R/"
"S numbers, and R/S sentences, is a system of hazard codes and phrases for "
"labeling dangerous chemicals and compounds. The R/S phrase of a compound "
"consists of a risk part (R) and a safety part (S), each followed by a "
"combination of numbers. Each number corresponds to a phrase. The phrase "
"corresponding to the letter/number combination has the same meaning in "
"different languages."
msgstr ""
"R/S fraze, takođe poznate kao Rizične i sigurne izjave, R/S izjave, R/S "
"brojevi i R/S rečenice, u sistemu hazard koda i fraza za označavanje opasnih "
"hemikalija i spojeva. R/S fraza spojeva sadrži rizični dio( R) i sigurni dio "
"(S); svaki popraćen kombnacijom brojeva. Svaki broj odgovara frazi. Fraza "
"koja odgovara slovu / broju kombinacije ima isto značenje u različitim "
"jezicima."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:788
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>R/S Phrases</quote> window"
msgstr "<quote>R/S fraze</quote> prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; can display Risk/Security Phrases"
msgstr "&kalzium; može prikazati Rizične/Sigurnosne fraze"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Rječnik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Glossary gives you definitions of the most used tools in chemistry as "
"well as some knowledge data. On the left side of the windows you can see the "
"tree of items. On top, there are chemical terms, below that there is a "
"second tree of laboratory-tools."
msgstr ""
"Rječnik vam daje definicije najčešće korištenih alata u hemiji i neko "
"znanje. Na lijevoj strani prozora možete vijdeti stablo stavki. Na vrhu, tu "
"su hemijski izrazi, ispod toga je drugo stablo laboratorijskih alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the top of the widget you can see a searchbar. If you type in the bar the "
"trees will be adjusted immediately. The small button in the right end of the "
"searchbar will clear it."
msgstr ""
"Na vrhu uređaja možete vidjeti polje za pretragu. Ako unesete u polje, "
"stabla će se prilagoditi odmah. Malo dugme na desnom kraju polja za pretragu "
"će ga očistiti."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:806
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Glossary</quote>"
msgstr "<quote>Rječnik</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Tables shows you the tables for Greek alphabet which is used to denote "
"some chemical and physical entities, and for Latin prefixes and Roman "
"numbers which correspond to common Arabic numbers."
msgstr ""
"Tabele prikazuju tablice za grčki alfabet koji je korišten za označavanje "
"hemijskih i fizičkih polja, i za latinske prefikse i rimske brojeve, što "
"odgovara arapskim brojevima."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:820
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Tables</quote> window"
msgstr "<quote>Tabele</quote> prozor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:826
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sidebar"
msgstr "Bočna traka"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:828
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Overview</title>"
msgstr "<title>Pregled</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Overview</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pregled</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:839
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Overview</guilabel> tab is the first one and it shows you an "
"overview of the element the mouse is over."
msgstr ""
"Tab <guilabel>Pregled</guilabel> je prvi tab i prikazuje prgled elementa na "
"kojemu je miš."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:843
#, no-c-format
msgid "View"
msgstr "Prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:845
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>View</guilabel> tab is the second in the navigation panel."
msgstr "Tab <guilabel>Prikaz</guilabel> je drugi tab u navigacijskog panelu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:846
#, no-c-format
msgid "You are first presented with the following icons and text:"
msgstr "Najprije su prikazani sljedeći tekstovi i ikone:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:853
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>State of Matter</quote> Dialog"
msgstr "<quote>Stanje tvari</quote> dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:855
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalzium; can show you which elements are solid/liquid/vaporous at a given "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"&kalzium; prikazuje koji su elementi čvrsti/tečni/gasoviti na datoj "
"temperaturi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:861
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>View</guilabel> tab can be used to filter PSE. For example, "
"this feature allows you to explore the elements of the set time period. This "
"is great for getting a feel for how the PSE evolved over time, as more and "
"more elements were discovered. Choose <guimenuitem>Discovery date</"
"guimenuitem> from <guilabel>Gradient</guilabel> list. If you move the slider "
"you will notice that color of some elements disappear if you move it to the "
"left and reappear if you move it to the right. Furthermore the number will "
"change constantly."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prikaz</guilabel> tab se koristi da filtrira PSE. Na primjer, ova "
"opcija dozvoljava vam da istražujete elemente u zadanom vremenskom "
"razdoblju. Ovo je sjajno za dobijanje osjećaja kako PSE napreduje preko "
"vremena, i kako je više i više elemenata otkriveno. Odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Odredi datum</guimenuitem> iz <guilabel>Gradijent</guilabel> "
"liste. Ako pokrenete klizač primijetit ćete da boja nekih elemenata nestaje "
"pri pokretanju lijevo i ponovo se prikazuje pri pokretanju desno. Štaviše "
"broj će se mijenjati konstantno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:865
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number represents the date you are looking at. If you move the slider to "
"&eg; 1856 you will only see the elements which where known in the year 1856."
msgstr ""
"Broj predstavlja datum koji posmatrate. Ako pomjerite klizač do &eg; 1856 "
"vidjet ćete samo elemene koji su bili poznati u 1856."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:875
#, no-c-format
msgid "the <quote>Discovery date</quote> gradient"
msgstr "<quote>Datum otkrivanje</quote> gradijent"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:877
#, no-c-format
msgid "The PSE back in time (elements known in 1856)"
msgstr "PSE nazad u vrijeme ( elementi poznati u 1856 )"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:888
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kalzium;"
msgstr "Konfigurisanje &kalzium;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalzium; has many configuration options, which you can access by opening "
"the configuration dialog by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kalzium;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"from the menu."
msgstr ""
"&kalzium; ima mnogo konfiguracijskih opcija, kojima možete pristupiti "
"otvarajući konfiguraioni dijalog odabirom <menuchoice> <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kalzium;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"iz menija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:896 index.docbook:910 index.docbook:924 index.docbook:941
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure &kalzium; Dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog konfiguracija &kalzium;-a"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:902
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schemes"
msgstr "Sheme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:906
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Schemes</guilabel> tab, you can change the different colors "
"for each scheme."
msgstr ""
"U tabu <guilabel>Scheme</guilabel>, možete promijeniti različite boje za "
"svaku shemu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:916
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Gradients</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Gradijenti</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:920
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of using a linear gradient to display the given property of an "
"element in the periodic table, &kalzium; can also use a logarithmic gradient."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto korištenja linearnog gradijenta da prikažete dato svojstvo elementa "
"u periodnom sistemu, &kalzium; može takođe da koristi logaritamski gradijent."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:921
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Gradients</guilabel> tab, you can check the properties you "
"want to have displayed with a logarithmic gradient."
msgstr ""
"U tablu <guilabel>Gradijenti</guilabel>, možete označiti svojstva koja "
"želite da prikažete logaritamskim gradijentom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:922
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also choose <guilabel>Maximal Value Color</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Minimal Value Color</guilabel> for the gradient."
msgstr ""
"Možete takođe odabrati  <guilabel>Maksimalna vrijednost boje</guilabel> i  "
"<guilabel>Minimalna vrijednost boje</guilabel>  za gradijent."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:930
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Jedinica mjere"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:934
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Units</guilabel> tab, you can choose the units for "
"temperature, length and energy. You can select if you prefer electronvolts "
"(eV), kilojoule per mole (kJ/mol) or joule per mole (J/mol) by default. For "
"length set picometers (pm), nanometers (nm) or Ångström (Å) as default. The "
"temperature is in kelvin by default but you can change to Celsius (°C), "
"Fahrenheit (°F) and Réaumur (°Ré)."
msgstr ""
"U  <guilabel>Jedinica mjere</guilabel>  tabu, možete odabrati jedinice mjere "
"za temperaturu, dužinu i energiju. Možete odabrati ako preferirate "
"elektronvolte (eV) kilodužule po molu (kJ/mol) ili džule po molu (J/mol) kao "
"zadano. Za dužinu postavite pikometre (pm) , nanometre (nm) ili Angtrome (A) "
"kao zadano. Tempreatura je u kelvinima kao zadana opcija ali možete je "
"promijeniti u Celzijuse (°C), Fahrenheit (°F) i Réaumur (°Ré)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:947
#, no-c-format
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:951
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Calculator</guilabel> page, you can configure &kalzium; "
"calculators."
msgstr ""
"Korištenjem <guilabel>Kalkulator</guilabel> stranice, možete konfigurisati "
"&kalzium; kalkulatore."

