#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1318
#, no-c-format
msgid "Will I ever have to pay for &kalzium;?"
msgstr "Da li ću ikada plaćati &kalzium;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1321
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "No, never. But the author always welcomes a nice mail or a DVD as a "
#| "<quote>Thank You</quote>. &kalzium; is licensed under the <ulink url="
#| "\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, so you "
#| "will never have to pay for this program."
msgid ""
"No, never. But the author always welcomes a nice mail or a DVD as a "
"<quote>Thank You</quote>. &kalzium; is licensed under the <ulink url="
"\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, so you will "
"never have to pay for this program."
msgstr ""
"Ne, nikada. Ali autori uvijek lijepo dočekaju fin mail ili DVD kao "
"<quote>Hvala</quote>. &kalzium; je licenciran pod <ulink url=\"http://www."
"gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, tako da nikada nećete "
"morati platiti za ovaj program."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1331
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I contribute?"
msgstr "Kako mogu doprinijeti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1337
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support me with data."
msgstr "Poduprite me sa podacima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the world of science, the progress is quite fast. If you ever find an "
"incorrect or missing value, please drop me an email."
msgstr ""
"U svijetu nauke, progres je jako brz. Ako ikada nađete neispravnu ili "
"nepostojeću virjednost, molimo obavijestite nas emailom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find some bugs or give some suggestions"
msgstr "Nađite greške ili dajte svoje sugestije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you find any bugs in the program, or have a few suggestions for "
"improvements, please let me know at &Carsten.Niehaus.mail;."
msgstr ""
"Ako nađete neke greške u programu, ili imate neke sugestije za poboljšanje, "
"molimo obavijestite me na &Carsten.Niehaus.mail;."

